  "name": "RECpy",
  "description": "Particularized demand forecasting and day-ahead battery scheduling for energy communities. Each consumer is given its own forecasting model, selected by a Wilcoxon signed-rank tournament over fifteen machine-learning regressors, ARIMA and SARIMAX, and three deep-learning architectures; the selected forecasts drive a linear programme that schedules a shared battery against day-ahead prices.",
